{
  "//": [
    "Index definition for the retrieval corpus. Applied over the REST API, not by Terraform —",
    "there is no azurerm_search_index resource. HOW-TO-DEPLOY.md has the curl.",
    "",
    "Two fields here are load-bearing and worth checking before every apply:",
    "",
    "  tenant_id must be filterable. The retrieve tool sends `tenant_id eq '...'` as the",
    "  vector query's filter. A schema that leaves this false deploys without complaint and",
    "  fails on the first real search with an unhelpful 400 — or worse, someone 'fixes' it by",
    "  dropping the filter.",
    "",
    "  classification must be filterable. It is the second half of the access decision: a",
    "  caller sees public and internal by default and only what their clearances list allows",
    "  beyond that.",
    "",
    "Neither is searchable. Making an access-control field searchable invites it into the",
    "free-text query path, where a full-text match is not an authorization decision.",
    "",
    "dimensions must match the embedding model the retrieve tool calls. 1536 is",
    "text-embedding-3-small. Change one and you must change the other; a mismatch is",
    "rejected at upload time, which is the good case, because a silent mismatch would mean",
    "meaningless similarity scores."
  ],
  "name": "knowledge",
  "fields": [
    {
      "name": "document_id",
      "type": "Edm.String",
      "key": true,
      "searchable": false,
      "filterable": true,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": false
    },
    {
      "name": "tenant_id",
      "type": "Edm.String",
      "searchable": false,
      "filterable": true,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": false
    },
    {
      "name": "classification",
      "type": "Edm.String",
      "searchable": false,
      "filterable": true,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": true
    },
    {
      "name": "document_type",
      "type": "Edm.String",
      "searchable": false,
      "filterable": true,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": true
    },
    {
      "name": "title",
      "type": "Edm.String",
      "searchable": true,
      "filterable": false,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": false
    },
    {
      "name": "source_uri",
      "type": "Edm.String",
      "searchable": false,
      "filterable": false,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": false
    },
    {
      "name": "text",
      "type": "Edm.String",
      "searchable": true,
      "filterable": false,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": false
    },
    {
      "name": "updated_at",
      "type": "Edm.DateTimeOffset",
      "searchable": false,
      "filterable": true,
      "sortable": true,
      "facetable": false
    },
    {
      "name": "embedding",
      "type": "Collection(Edm.Single)",
      "searchable": true,
      "filterable": false,
      "sortable": false,
      "facetable": false,
      "retrievable": false,
      "dimensions": 1536,
      "vectorSearchProfile": "knowledge-hnsw"
    }
  ],
  "vectorSearch": {
    "algorithms": [
      {
        "name": "knowledge-hnsw-config",
        "kind": "hnsw",
        "hnswParameters": {
          "metric": "cosine",
          "m": 4,
          "efConstruction": 400,
          "efSearch": 500
        }
      }
    ],
    "profiles": [
      {
        "name": "knowledge-hnsw",
        "algorithm": "knowledge-hnsw-config"
      }
    ]
  },
  "semantic": {
    "configurations": [
      {
        "name": "knowledge-semantic",
        "prioritizedFields": {
          "titleField": {
            "fieldName": "title"
          },
          "prioritizedContentFields": [
            {
              "fieldName": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
